How the filtering works
The program uses five filtering conditions:

Region: Users can select multiple regions. If none are selected, all regions are included.

Year: Only cars within the selected year range are returned.

Transmission: Users can choose Manual, Automatic, or Any.

Make: Searches manufacturers using partial text matching.

Model: Searches models using partial text matching.

The filters are combined using and, so a car must satisfy every selected preference to appear in the results.

